OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after tractor with
OL,4,Atrailer crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 20s has died after a crash
OL,7,Finvolving a tractor with a trailer.
OL,9,FDevon and Cornwall Police said officers
OL,10,Fwere called to a single-vehicle crash
OL,11,Fon an unclassified road close to St
OL,12,FEwe, near St Austell, Cornwall at about
OL,13,F22:10 BST on Friday 11 September.
OL,15,FThe driver, a local man in his 20s, was
OL,16,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
