OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after tractor with
OL,4,Atrailer crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers thanked members of the public
OL,7,Ffor their patience while the road
OL,8,Fremained closed while an examination of
OL,9,Fthe scene was carried out. The
OL,10,Fcircumstances of the collision continue
OL,11,Fto be investigated, the force
OL,12,Fconfirmed.
